    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d974-a1">

                <pb facs="0944" n="846" sameAs="frus:frus1900/pg846"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure.]</seg></opener>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Arroqo to Mr. Thieriot</hi>.</head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Translation.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Foreign Office</hi>, <hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Lisbon</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian" when="1900-07-23"
                                ><hi rendition="#italic">July 23,
                    1900</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>I beg to inform your excellency that His Majesty’s Government made a deposit at
                    the agency of the Comptoir National d’Escompte, in London, on the morning of the
                    21st instant, pursuant to the final award of the court of arbitration at Berne,
                    payable to the order of the Government of the United States of North America,
                    and to that of Her Britannic Majesty, and as a complete discharge from all
                    responsibility on the part of Portugal, a sum equal to the indemnity by the
                    aforesaid court, with the additional amount of interest at 5 per cent from the
                    25th June, 1889, to the 21st of the present month, the date of payment.</p>
                <p>I embrace this opportunity to renew, etc.,</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">oad A. Arroqo.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
